  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759037,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10 Super Jogos for Sega Mega Drive / Genesis\n\nRelive the golden age of 16-bit gaming with *10 Super Jogos*, a compilation of ten classic Sega Mega Drive titles originally released in Brazil. Bundled with the Tectoy Mega Drive III console and later available as a standalone cartridge, this collection offers a fantastic introduction to the era's iconic games.\n\nExperience a diverse range of gameplay, from the action-packed platforming of *Sonic the Hedgehog* and *Sonic the Hedgehog 2* to the thrilling combat of *Streets of Rage*. Test your skills in *Golden Axe*, explore the challenging levels of *Altered Beast*, and engage in the fast-paced racing of *Hang-On*. Other included titles are *Shinobi*, *Gunstar Heroes*, *Comix Zone*, *Earthworm Jim*, and *Sunset Riders*.\n\n*10 Super Jogos* provides a convenient and affordable way to enjoy a selection of Sega's most beloved games, showcasing the console's impressive capabilities and delivering hours of nostalgic fun. A must-have for Mega Drive/Genesis enthusiasts and a great starting point for those new to the platform."
    },
